WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.750
Student council room

00:01.100 --> 00:03.190
Finally, the new school term has begun.

00:03.980 --> 00:08.650
I look forward to working with you as the new student council.

00:09.340 --> 00:16.670
Let's work hard to make Hinominami High School a truly exciting place!

00:17.960 --> 00:19.070
That's it!

00:19.320 --> 00:24.940
I've been busy with Shikanoko, but this is what I'm aiming for!

00:25.460 --> 00:27.000
Koshi-tan didn't know.

00:27.480 --> 00:29.780
There is a secret within this student council.

00:30.000 --> 00:30.670
That is!

00:34.670 --> 00:38.830
One of these three plans to disband the Deer Club.

00:39.810 --> 00:42.230
Meanwhile, at the targeted Deer Club,

00:43.400 --> 00:45.560
Nokotan was sunbathing.

