02:29.700 --> 02:30.770
First, let's make booklets for the new students. Let's print this out.

02:30.770 --> 02:35.280
First, let's make booklets for the new students. Let's print this out.

02:35.490 --> 02:36.130
President.

02:37.240 --> 02:40.530
Nekoyamada Neko
3rd grade
Position: Vice President

02:37.670 --> 02:40.180
The printing is already done.

02:42.200 --> 02:44.960
Did you prepare all this?

02:45.290 --> 02:47.020
Amazing, amazing!

02:48.420 --> 02:49.260
Yes.

02:49.740 --> 02:52.140
You should be more grateful and bow down to me.

02:52.760 --> 02:57.030
After all, my ambition is to overthrow you!

03:00.360 --> 03:01.720
New Student Council President!

03:01.760 --> 03:03.160
Congratulations!

03:03.350 --> 03:04.660
Koshi-san! Look this way!

03:05.020 --> 03:06.210
What is it!?

03:06.820 --> 03:10.220
Outstanding grades, the admiration of all students.

03:10.930 --> 03:11.970
What is it!?

03:12.600 --> 03:17.150
Moreover, even the mysterious Deer Club seems to be quite popular.

03:17.390 --> 03:19.770
What is it!?

03:20.700 --> 03:22.180
I've decided!

03:22.640 --> 03:25.840
I will expose her as a fraud, force the Deer Club to disband,

03:25.870 --> 03:30.590
and knock her off her perch as both Student Council President and school's Madonna!

03:31.610 --> 03:35.370
To do that, I need to find her weakness!

03:35.880 --> 03:39.370
Revealing the enemy right away is the style of this story.

03:40.450 --> 03:42.130
Thank you, Nekoyamada-san.

03:42.420 --> 03:43.870
You work fast.

03:44.210 --> 03:47.440
But President, aren't you working too slowly?

03:47.940 --> 03:51.250
Our future looks bleak with someone like you as president.

03:52.030 --> 03:57.950
She doesn't seem like a bad person, prickly but dependable.

04:01.160 --> 04:03.020
Alright.

04:04.070 --> 04:05.060
Come on, President!

04:05.370 --> 04:08.400
Don't dawdle, get to work!

04:08.830 --> 04:09.890
Gosh!

04:10.560 --> 04:11.490
Cute!

04:12.390 --> 04:13.910
Hey, are you listening!?

04:14.270 --> 04:16.810
Hey, listen to me!

04:14.370 --> 04:17.590
Nekoyamada Neko
Notes:132cm tall
Personal belongings: MY stepladder

04:17.040 --> 04:17.790
Hey!

04:18.460 --> 04:20.040
Um, President!

04:21.450 --> 04:24.240
I've finished sorting these printouts!

04:24.470 --> 04:27.850
Tanukikoji Kinu
2nd grade
Position: Secretary

04:29.310 --> 04:31.090
Thank you, Tanukikoji-san.

04:31.410 --> 04:32.280
You've been a great help.

04:32.710 --> 04:36.050
N-no, this is all I can do.

04:36.210 --> 04:37.690
Then, next…

04:38.250 --> 04:38.780
Oh?

04:39.010 --> 04:41.210
This might be slightly out of order.

04:44.070 --> 04:48.530
S-s-sorry,

04:48.800 --> 04:50.680
A face like the end of the world!

04:51.360 --> 04:53.460
I-it's okay, Tanukikoji-san.

04:53.710 --> 04:54.770
Let's fix it together.

04:54.870 --> 05:01.620
No, if I can't even do office work, maybe I'm not cut out for student council!

05:01.950 --> 05:03.120
That's not true.

05:03.370 --> 05:05.000
Everyone makes mistakes.

05:05.750 --> 05:06.410
But…

05:07.000 --> 05:13.450
What if these prints get to the first-years in the wrong order.

05:14.580 --> 05:17.580
Starting the new term in confusion…

05:17.960 --> 05:20.040
N-no, it won't go that far.

05:20.970 --> 05:26.910
Because of me, the first-year students will be in chaos, the student council will lose credibility,

05:27.360 --> 05:32.670
and you, Koshi-san, will be forced to resign as president and leave the school…

05:28.780 --> 05:29.910
Dismissed!

05:33.300 --> 05:35.940
You have quite the imagination.

05:36.670 --> 05:39.550
If that happens, I-I,

05:40.230 --> 05:43.630
I will commit sudoku in front of all the students!

05:43.780 --> 05:45.810
That's too extreme!

05:46.490 --> 05:51.310
Hmm, the student council has some pretty quirky members.

05:52.170 --> 05:53.170
That's reassuring.

05:54.980 --> 05:58.180
Tsubameya Chiharu
2nd grade
Position: Accounting

06:08.580 --> 06:10.120
Oh, by the way…

06:10.720 --> 06:13.070
Tsubameya-san, why did you join the student council?

06:14.140 --> 06:15.360
Kinu invited me.

06:16.000 --> 06:17.210
I-I see.

06:19.460 --> 06:23.300
Is there anything you'd like to do in the student council?

06:24.080 --> 06:24.840
Not particularly.

06:35.850 --> 06:37.780
The conversation isn't expanding at all!

06:38.180 --> 06:41.050
What? Is this how recent high school girls are?

06:41.340 --> 06:43.500
Koshi-tan is also a recent high school girl.

06:44.020 --> 06:46.970
But we'll be working together for a year,

06:47.310 --> 06:48.880
so we need to bond.

06:49.690 --> 06:50.420
Um…

06:51.210 --> 06:52.070
Ah, yes!

06:52.520 --> 06:56.690
I'd like to ask you something, President.

07:01.730 --> 07:06.550
Is it true you're also the head of the Deer Club?

07:07.750 --> 07:10.130
Yes, but why?

07:10.590 --> 07:11.300
No reason.

07:18.470 --> 07:20.370
What? Why did she ask?

07:20.900 --> 07:23.800
Does she know the Deer Club is a silly club?

07:24.780 --> 07:26.970
It's all or nothing.

07:29.020 --> 07:30.060
Tsubameya-san!

07:30.320 --> 07:33.300
Are you hoping to join the Deer Club?

07:36.210 --> 07:37.210
Seriously, what!

07:37.410 --> 07:38.820
What kind of expression is that.

07:39.400 --> 07:41.720
Alright, Tsubame and Tanuki!

07:41.980 --> 07:45.600
Keep putting pressure on her like that.

07:47.060 --> 07:50.660
It's only a matter of time before she shows her weakness.

07:54.030 --> 07:56.460
Phew, we're finally done.

07:57.090 --> 07:58.480
Everyone, good job.

07:58.740 --> 08:00.920
I'm sorry I couldn't be more help.

08:01.970 --> 08:03.830
Oh, it's already this late.

08:04.320 --> 08:06.030
I have to hurry to my club.

08:06.560 --> 08:08.050
It can't be helped.

08:08.250 --> 08:11.410
We'll lock up the student council room.

08:11.760 --> 08:12.890
Really?

08:13.200 --> 08:14.930
Thank you!

08:15.130 --> 08:16.270
As expected of the vice president!

08:16.390 --> 08:17.510
You're reliable!

08:19.740 --> 08:22.230
Oh, Koshi-tan is late!

08:22.400 --> 08:23.400
Shut up!

08:23.660 --> 08:26.520
I was held up by student council work!

08:31.520 --> 08:35.100
Phew, that's it for today.

08:35.650 --> 08:39.970
Well, we're heading home too. Oh no!

08:40.300 --> 08:46.060
I got so caught up in the work that I couldn't do anything for the Deer Club!

08:46.710 --> 08:47.820
Hang in there, Nekochan!

08:48.140 --> 08:51.590
The battle to disband the Deer Club has only just begun!

08:51.970 --> 08:54.400
Nyaaaaa!

08:54.540 --> 08:58.020
Ibaraki Prefecture
Kashima Shrine

08:58.070 --> 09:01.510
Ibaraki Prefecture
Kashima Shrine
Mitarai Pond

09:02.600 --> 09:04.010
I am Koshi Torako.

09:04.580 --> 09:07.250
I'm the head of the Deer Club and the student council president.

09:08.090 --> 09:09.680
On the surface, I'm an honor student.

09:10.190 --> 09:12.060
But the truth is, I used to be a delinquent,

09:12.620 --> 09:15.830
and it would be disastrous if anyone other than the Deer Club members found out!

09:16.380 --> 09:17.080
That's right!

09:17.730 --> 09:18.730
Even at a time like this!

09:19.080 --> 09:20.080
Ah, Koshi-tan!

09:20.270 --> 09:21.620
We have a visitor!

09:24.060 --> 09:25.280
T-Tsubameya-san!

09:25.530 --> 09:28.610
Welcome! Did you come to visit the Deer Club?

09:29.620 --> 09:30.790
Thanks for having me.

09:31.530 --> 09:32.300
Wait, what!?

09:32.530 --> 09:33.520
What's this situation!?

09:33.800 --> 09:35.260
Why is Tsubameya here in the Deer Club!?

09:36.770 --> 09:39.950
Could it be that she's really interested in the Deer Club?

09:41.020 --> 09:42.900
I love Deer Club…

09:43.860 --> 09:44.570
That would be bad.

09:44.890 --> 09:47.850
At this rate, my true nature in the Deer Club will be exposed!

09:48.980 --> 09:52.260
So the president used to be a delinquent.

09:53.240 --> 09:54.120
Then!

09:54.610 --> 09:59.410
I must show that I'm a model student even in the Deer Club!

10:00.190 --> 10:01.760
Shikanoko-san, a word.

10:03.900 --> 10:07.460
Listen, until she leaves, don't do anything unnecessary!

10:07.880 --> 10:09.150
Oh, what's this?

10:09.390 --> 10:10.180
Just don't.

10:10.290 --> 10:13.050
I don't get it, but sure, no problem.

10:13.870 --> 10:18.010
Tsubameya-san! Thank you for visiting the Deer Club to…

10:18.450 --> 10:21.810
By the way, Tsubame-senpai, do you prefer sticky rice

10:21.840 --> 10:23.950
or Yumepirika rice?

10:21.840 --> 10:23.950
*Japan's rice brand, grown in Hokkaido

10:25.710 --> 10:29.890
In my spoiled relationship with my sister, I won't let anyone interfere.

10:36.850 --> 10:41.460
By the way, Tsubameya-san, do you know what kind of activities the Deer Club does?

10:42.590 --> 10:43.440
Activities?

10:44.070 --> 10:45.070
Gotcha!

10:46.580 --> 10:50.620
The Deer Club actually does a variety of activities. For example…

10:50.960 --> 10:55.370
We interact with wild deer, like this time Koshi-tan…

10:55.740 --> 10:58.200
Take it off! Take off the costume!

11:00.130 --> 11:01.860
Aaaagh!

11:03.030 --> 11:04.690
Don't do anything unnecessary!

11:05.020 --> 11:06.700
Why is there even a video of this…

11:07.260 --> 11:09.860
It's a recording of the third episode from the last broadcast.

11:10.270 --> 11:15.960
I was just introducing the Deer Club's activities, showing how we communicate with wild deer.

11:16.040 --> 11:17.770
That's unnecessary!

11:18.050 --> 11:19.880
And that deer isn't even wild!

11:20.580 --> 11:21.720
Fumufumu.

11:21.950 --> 11:26.080
Everyone has a dark history, like writing original songs.

11:26.470 --> 11:27.830
Just as expected of my sister.

11:28.270 --> 11:30.190
She always sings in the bath.

11:33.990 --> 11:35.010
Dark history…

11:35.090 --> 11:37.040
N-no, Tsubameya-san!

11:37.080 --> 11:39.040
This video was just a little fun…

11:39.140 --> 11:40.390
Fun!?

11:40.970 --> 11:44.200
Are you saying that day was just fun for you, Koshi-tan!?

11:44.500 --> 11:46.540
Even Tsunoda-san would be crying!

11:46.730 --> 11:49.020
Can you keep quiet before it gets more complicated!?

11:49.160 --> 11:50.640
And who is Tsunoda-san!?

11:52.470 --> 11:53.840
Oh, Tsunoda-san.

11:53.890 --> 11:56.150
It's you! Why are you escaping again?

11:57.800 --> 11:59.140
T-this is bad…

11:59.230 --> 12:00.620
Um, um…

12:00.910 --> 12:03.160
Anyway, would you like some tea?

12:04.070 --> 12:05.420
Thank you.

12:07.570 --> 12:12.190
Even so, she's as inscrutable as ever.

12:12.850 --> 12:16.700
She's not a bad person, but there's a wall…

12:20.640 --> 12:22.410
Ah crap!

12:23.370 --> 12:25.090
What are you doing!

12:25.530 --> 12:26.050
Nyan?

12:26.260 --> 12:28.190
What? I'm just being hospitable?

12:28.240 --> 12:30.030
Don't serve deer snacks as hospitality!

12:30.390 --> 12:34.790
S-sorry, Tsubameya-san. Our deer is acting strange…

12:40.700 --> 12:43.260
She looks clearly happy…

12:43.750 --> 12:48.480
Wow, if you're this happy, it's worth the hospitality!

12:48.910 --> 12:52.250
Oh, right! Let's give her something special!

12:54.140 --> 12:54.560
Here you go.

12:54.760 --> 12:55.800
Grass!

12:56.040 --> 12:56.590
No way!

12:56.650 --> 12:59.070
Who would be happy to receive grass!

13:02.530 --> 13:03.630
There she is!

13:03.720 --> 13:05.570
Right in front of me!

13:06.360 --> 13:07.560
It's strange.

13:07.690 --> 13:10.670
Why does she react so little to me

13:10.850 --> 13:13.140
but seems happy with Shikanoko?

13:13.730 --> 13:16.370
I also want to be liked by my Kouhai!

13:16.450 --> 13:18.530
I want to be admired as a Senpai!

13:18.890 --> 13:20.890
I don't want to lose to Shikanoko!

13:21.950 --> 13:23.490
Koshi-tan tried hard.

13:24.030 --> 13:28.340
Like a dog that won't get attached,

13:28.480 --> 13:31.110
she tried various ways to win over the Kouhai.

13:31.240 --> 13:32.770
But…

13:33.600 --> 13:35.310
An hour later

13:33.950 --> 13:34.990
Total defeat!

13:35.840 --> 13:37.060
Utter!

13:37.640 --> 13:38.600
Defeat!

13:39.170 --> 13:41.710
Could it be that she dislikes me?

13:43.310 --> 13:43.820
Um,

13:44.770 --> 13:46.160
I should going now.

13:47.030 --> 13:48.770
Thank you for everything.

13:49.430 --> 13:50.990
Oh, okay.

13:51.540 --> 13:53.750
Well, come again.

13:55.980 --> 13:56.520
Yes.

14:00.930 --> 14:04.860
To recognize the quality of that grass, she has quite the discerning eye!

14:06.380 --> 14:07.260
Senpai

14:07.700 --> 14:08.530
Dignity

14:13.370 --> 14:14.090
I'm home.

14:14.550 --> 14:15.550
Oh, Chiharu.

14:15.680 --> 14:16.660
Welcome back. Hm!

14:17.210 --> 14:18.480
What's with that face!

14:18.850 --> 14:19.940
Hey! Chiharu!

14:21.950 --> 14:23.290
Come again.

14:24.170 --> 14:29.190
Senpai… Nokotan-senpai noticed me!

14:29.530 --> 14:30.560
Let me explain.

14:31.030 --> 14:36.350
Tsubameya Chiharu seems like a normal girl, but in reality, she's a huge Nokotan fan!

14:38.480 --> 14:42.290
Ah, seeing Nokotan-senpai up close was so cute!

14:42.470 --> 14:46.210
Since Koshi-tan was there, she'd be able to talk without getting nervous,

14:46.430 --> 14:49.400
so she gathered the courage to go meet Nokotan!

14:49.870 --> 14:50.830
By the way,

14:51.440 --> 14:55.030
I was so jealous of how President could talk normally with Nokotan-senpai,

14:55.190 --> 14:56.970
so I couldn't help but stare.

14:58.130 --> 15:00.540
I hope I didn't upset her.

15:04.350 --> 15:05.410
The next day

15:06.370 --> 15:07.480
I won't lose!

15:07.700 --> 15:09.650
I won't lose to Shikanoko!

15:09.920 --> 15:12.820
I also want to be a Senpai admired by Kouhai!

15:20.580 --> 15:22.040
Ah, s-sorry!

15:22.890 --> 15:24.130
Tanukikoji-san?

15:25.530 --> 15:26.300
President…

15:27.840 --> 15:29.150
I'm sorry, President.

15:29.400 --> 15:32.640
For having you help me with my menial tasks.

15:33.240 --> 15:34.170
Don't worry about it.

15:34.330 --> 15:38.120
I was free, so it's faster if we do it together.

15:38.720 --> 15:41.160
Senpai admired by Kouhai, Point 1:

15:41.380 --> 15:44.030
Quickly lend a hand when they are in trouble.

15:44.490 --> 15:46.790
Thank you, President.

15:47.960 --> 15:51.620
So, we're counting the supplies, right?

15:52.220 --> 15:55.330
It's my first time in the gym equipment storage.

15:55.540 --> 15:56.680
Same here.

15:56.930 --> 16:01.050
Oh, in manga, people often get trapped in gym equipment storage rooms.

16:01.520 --> 16:03.700
Senpai admired by Kouhai, Point 2:

16:04.160 --> 16:06.100
Casually make jokes.

16:06.430 --> 16:08.690
We might get trapped too!

16:10.940 --> 16:14.320
Hey, make sure to lock the door properly!

16:14.560 --> 16:15.270
Sorry!

16:16.540 --> 16:19.200
But there are still people inside!

16:23.990 --> 16:25.640
Tanukikoji-san, are you okay?

16:30.590 --> 16:32.000
Not okay at all!

16:33.190 --> 16:34.620
What a cliché situation.

16:37.500 --> 16:38.600
This is a problem.

16:38.650 --> 16:39.940
I could call for help,

16:40.010 --> 16:43.990
but no one usually comes here, and my phone is in my bag…

16:46.750 --> 16:47.840
Tanukikoji-san?

16:48.110 --> 16:49.940
What are you… Ugh!

16:50.280 --> 16:53.450
Hey, hey, hey! Stop it! Don't jinx us!

16:53.920 --> 16:57.560
B-but we might never get out of here!

16:57.840 --> 16:59.320
No way!

16:59.540 --> 17:01.590
How could you even think that!

17:01.800 --> 17:05.050
A locked gym storage room, a rom-com classic…

17:05.500 --> 17:09.580
But ending up like that with the President is too far-fetched!

17:10.510 --> 17:12.800
So, the only path left is?

17:13.270 --> 17:15.790
No one comes to rescue us, days pass by…

17:16.350 --> 17:17.600
Our energy dwindles…

17:18.120 --> 17:19.520
Our spirits deplete…

17:19.980 --> 17:22.200
And we end up as ghosts!

17:22.890 --> 17:29.550
Then our story is retold forever as some lame video!

17:31.800 --> 17:32.670
I'm watching you.

17:33.140 --> 17:34.820
Your thought process is quite a leap.

17:35.020 --> 17:36.630
And very imaginative.

17:37.070 --> 17:38.600
D-don't worry.

17:38.860 --> 17:42.330
Someone concerned will come looking for us before that happens.

17:45.550 --> 17:47.400
Do you hear something?

17:47.910 --> 17:49.040
That voice…

17:53.910 --> 17:54.910
Shikanoko!?

17:55.250 --> 17:56.650
Why is she here!?

17:56.810 --> 17:58.920
Not that it matters right now!

17:59.440 --> 18:00.220
Hey, Shika…

18:00.630 --> 18:03.380
Shikanoko-san! It's me! Koshi Torako!

18:07.970 --> 18:10.410
“Let's Become Family, in Hino”
Lyrics, Song, and Composition by Shikanoko Noko

18:10.450 --> 18:16.180
Separated from the herd, stray deer cracker lost in Hino

18:16.410 --> 18:21.710
A deer cracker lost on the road

18:21.880 --> 18:25.140
You are freezing alone

18:25.190 --> 18:29.260
Holding you in my arms, I brought you home

18:29.750 --> 18:33.320
That night

18:32.230 --> 18:34.550
Shikanoko-san? What's with this song!?

18:34.740 --> 18:39.550
One deer, one cracker, together as one

18:40.530 --> 18:45.590
Drawing close, a strong bond

18:45.870 --> 18:48.360
There it is.

18:48.390 --> 18:52.880
We became like family

18:51.260 --> 18:53.620
Are you listening, Shikanoko-san?

18:53.640 --> 18:59.120
But those eyes, looking lonely

18:59.140 --> 19:01.860
In truth, knowing

19:01.920 --> 19:04.610
Hino isn't good enough

19:04.640 --> 19:07.370
Nara's deer

19:07.390 --> 19:08.870
Were calling

19:08.900 --> 19:13.670
For you!

19:11.250 --> 19:13.030
You threw it away!

19:13.130 --> 19:14.360
You ruined the moment!

19:14.500 --> 19:15.530
What's with this song?

19:15.910 --> 19:16.570
Yoo-hoo!

19:17.020 --> 19:19.270
It's good for the for Kohaku!

19:17.020 --> 19:19.270
*annual singing competition in Japan on New Year's

19:19.470 --> 19:20.200
Is it?

19:21.380 --> 19:22.920
This is no time for that!

19:23.060 --> 19:24.990
Hey! Wait!

19:26.380 --> 19:27.640
She's gone…

19:29.190 --> 19:32.940
Seems like we'll just have to wait for help, Tanukikoji-san.

19:33.810 --> 19:34.230
Huh?

19:34.650 --> 19:36.050
Tanukikoji-san, where are you?

19:36.840 --> 19:37.470
Here.

19:37.900 --> 19:39.630
Um, but why?

19:39.980 --> 19:41.640
I'm reflecting.

19:41.930 --> 19:42.940
Reflecting?

19:43.580 --> 19:46.250
It's my fault we got locked in.

19:46.880 --> 19:48.180
I'm being punished.

19:49.440 --> 19:50.620
Talk to me!

19:52.110 --> 19:59.340
I don't know what kind of punishment, but maybe I can help a bit, Tanukikoji-san.

20:00.560 --> 20:01.340
President…

20:01.800 --> 20:06.440
Senpai admired by Kouhai, Point 3: Listen to their problems

20:07.000 --> 20:10.110
In my class self-introduction…

20:11.010 --> 20:12.010
In your self-introduction?

20:12.870 --> 20:18.360
I lied and said, “I like cooking” even though I've never cooked before.

20:18.720 --> 20:21.380
Such an innocent mistake…

20:21.760 --> 20:22.970
She pretends to be an honor student

20:22.970 --> 20:23.720
but as a delinquent,

20:23.720 --> 20:25.550
she's the one telling the biggest lie of his life.

20:26.100 --> 20:28.890
I claimed my specialty was rice with raw egg on top!

20:29.170 --> 20:33.260
But I'm a liar as a student council member, so I'm being punished!

20:33.330 --> 20:35.090
You're being too negative!

20:35.180 --> 20:37.000
Just come out!

20:37.450 --> 20:38.450
Never!

20:38.550 --> 20:40.710
I'll reflect here forever!

20:43.470 --> 20:45.250
The door!

20:50.780 --> 20:54.060
Shikanoko-saaan!

20:54.490 --> 20:55.540
Koshi-tan!

20:58.400 --> 20:59.930
Did you come to rescue us?

21:00.730 --> 21:01.710
What are you talking about?

21:02.120 --> 21:06.420
I just came to check on the mushrooms I'm secretly growing in the vaulting box.

21:06.440 --> 21:08.070
You were doing that!?

21:08.520 --> 21:12.000
What are you doing here, Koshi-tan? Hide and seek?

21:12.230 --> 21:14.570
No, I'm not…

21:15.320 --> 21:17.960
Are you after my mushrooms?

21:18.000 --> 21:19.180
Of course not!

21:20.100 --> 21:24.930
Right, I was excited to finally harvest them today.

21:30.710 --> 21:32.410
You're thief!

21:33.140 --> 21:34.140
Sorry!

21:34.170 --> 21:36.380
What are you even saying!

21:37.460 --> 21:39.570
Koshi-tan and Tanuki safely returned.

21:47.790 --> 21:48.610
More, please

21:54.850 --> 21:56.850
Student council room

21:59.140 --> 22:01.740
Why is no one coming!?

22:02.200 --> 22:04.410
NYAAAAAAAAAAA!

